  "description": "The Eve’E 5 is a comfortable and elegant electrically assisted bicycle that is built around an aluminium frame and Shimano’s new Steps E5000 motor with a 504wh battery. A unique cover hides the battery and gives more style. One of the key features of the Eve line is the Gates belt drive, which is a cleaner alternative to a traditional chain. Also equipped with a 5-speed Shimano Nexus, Impac tyres and hydrollic disc brakes that offer faultless stopping in all conditions. The upright, relaxed position will allow you to enjoy the views, while the electric motor will make covering long distances or climbing hills a breeze. This practical, modern bike is dressed up in unique Creme styling, with a Creme saddle and grips, an aluminium basket, mount and rear rack. Mixing classic looks with modern function. Finished with an exceptionally beautiful multi layer gloss paint with a powder coat in Champagne and Ash Gray.",
